    "name": "Can a Garage Become a Legal Bedroom in San Diego, Chula Vista, or Coronado?",
    "text": "Can a Garage Become a Legal Bedroom in San Diego, Chula Vista, or Coronado?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "A garage-to-bedroom conversion may be possible, but approval depends on the property’s jurisdiction, zoning, parking conditions, existing construction, and the room’s ability to meet habitable-space and life-safety requirements. Before hiring a contractor, confirm the permit path and ask how the design will address egress, insulation, heating, alarms, moisture, utilities, and the former garage opening.",
      "@type": "Answer",
      "author": {
        "name": "Elite Remodeling & Design",
        "@type": "Organization"
      }
    }
